      "content": "thanks but a \"small break\" feels like a joke. like a bandaid on a gunshot wound. everything is permanent. the debt doesn't go away with a nap, the expectations don't just vanish. it feels like i'm just stuck in this loop of suffering and there's no actual exit. it's like being buried alive but everyone expects me to keep smiling and working like nothing is wrong. it's just... hopeless.",
